Subject: [PATCH] Service Razor's MessagePack dependency within the 2.5 line

Replace Razor's single central MessagePack 2.5.187 pin with 2.5.303. Nine
publisher advisories below are fixed in 2.5.301; the nested-array allocation
issue requires 2.5.303 and explicitly affects 2.5.302. Keep NuGet audit enabled.

The publisher retains netstandard2.0, net6.0 and net472 assets in 2.5.303,
covering Razor's existing target frameworks without a major API migration.
The original Razor build and SDK tests remain required; native qualification also
requires the complete offline SDK smoke, ELF and system-library checks.
The actual restored nupkg, its license/repository metadata and package source
are retained by the producer alongside this exact downstream source patch.

